\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16200 \cf2 Attendance, sharing, and communication\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 This is a studio: much of the learning comes from making work available to other people and encountering theirs. Attendance therefore matters, but the policy should not reward coming to class sick or require students to disclose private medical information.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Every student has 
\f0\b two no-fault studio passes
\f1\b0 . No documentation or explanation is required.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 A pass covers the class meeting and its live share. The weekly artifact and reflection remain due unless an extension is arranged.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 After the two passes, each 
\f0\b uncommunicated
\f1\b0  missed class removes 5 points from the 20-point Attendance & Sharing category.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 If a student communicates before class or as soon as reasonably possible, they may recover the presence credit through an alternative contribution: for example, a make-up demo, a recorded or office-hours share, or thoughtful feedback on classmates' work.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Absences for approved disability accommodations or religious observances do not consume the two passes. Other university-required accommodations will be honored.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Students should not attend class in person when ill. Students do not need to disclose the nature of an illness or provide a doctor's note; they should simply say they cannot attend and ask for the recovery path.\cb1 \
\ls5\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Students who are sick or isolating may ask to join that session over Zoom instead. Zoom is for being sick; the class itself happens in the room.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 None of this is meant as punishment. The only thing that is genuinely hard to work with is silence \'97 if something is going on, say so and we will figure out the rest.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa268\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16200 \cf2 Late and incomplete work\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 Students may submit normal weekly work up to seven days late for full credit when they communicate a recovery plan. After seven days, the instructor and student will agree on the smallest meaningful way to rejoin the current studio cycle rather than accumulating an impossible backlog.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa268\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16200 \cf2 Feedback philosophy\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 Scores only track whether the required work is there. The feedback is where the useful information lives: what you might try next.\
The instructor will give short, forward-looking feedback on weekly reflections and more substantial feedback at key points in the semester. Peer feedback, self-assessment, and live critique are core course practices. Feedback exists to support learning and revision; it is not a disguised system for marking students down on taste.\
Students will receive meaningful feedback on the week-one intention baseline early enough to inform whether and how they continue in the course.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa268\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16200 \cf2 Use of AI in this class\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 AI use is expected. Students may use AI for ideation, research, questions, drafting, code, media generation, analysis, critique, and revision unless a specific brief says otherwise. Using AI does not transfer responsibility: students remain accountable for claims, sources, choices, effects, and submitted work.\
For every Studio Cycle:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 disclose any material AI tools or systems used;\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 be able to explain what the system contributed and what you accepted, changed, or rejected;\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 do not submit private, confidential, or another person's identifying information to a tool without permission; and\cb1 \
\ls6\ilvl0\cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 write the required reflection yourself. AI may ask questions or help you think, but it may not compose or rewrite that paragraph for submission. Standard spelling, grammar, and approved assistive technologies are allowed. Students who need an accommodation should speak privately with the instructor.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Misrepresenting AI-generated work as a required reflection, fabricating process evidence, or using AI in a way explicitly prohibited by an assignment may be treated as an academic integrity violation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 Tooling:
\f1\b0  ChatGPT Edu is free with your CU Boulder login (note: it does not include Codex). In week 2 we will claim the $100 Codex student credit offer together in class. Beyond that shared floor, any AI tool you are drawn to is welcome \'97 image and video tools included.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa268\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32\fsmilli16200 \cf2 Week one assignment: intention baseline\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs30\fsmilli15200 \cf2 No separate created artifact is required in week one. Submit three paragraphs in your own voice:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Starting point \'97 you and AI right now:
\f1\b0  Where are you beginning? Reflect on your current relationship with AI: how you have been using it, how that relationship has grown or changed, and how you have felt impacted by it \'97 alongside what you already know how to make.\cb1 \
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Intention:
\f1\b0  What do you want to become capable of in this class, and why does it matter to you?\cb1 \
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	3	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Possible direction:
\f1\b0  What is something you might make, and what obstacles or kinds of support can you already see?\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 Three paragraphs is a minimum. Write more if you have more to say. Grammar is not being policed; what you are practicing is saying clearly what you mean. AI may ask you questions, but the submitted prose should be yours. This counts as the first low-stakes Studio Cycle: the intention statement is the artifact, the prose is the reflection, and a brief share will help the room start to see what everyone wants to learn.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa303\partightenfactor0

